ed by this  massive mansion it seems that at the  very least if she was born in the attack  on titan universe  then she would fulfill the criteria to  be the next warhammer titan  as she comes from a wealthy family and  is able to create things very well as  we've seen  so yeah she would inherit the warhammer  titan moving over to the draw titan now  i say that this is the swiftest titan  around and it has a set of jaws  that can bite through virtually anything  this titan would be perfect for baka go  and not just because he looks like this  when he's angry bakugo's movements in  battle are perhaps the best of anyone in  class 1a  i mean they were so good that deku  decided to copy them so clearly you know  he's doing something right  another thing to mention is probably the  draw titan sharp clause  i mean i could definitely see bakago  putting those to use so if he was in  this universe  then he would be a worthy draw titan  the founding titan is the next one we're  going to choose a candidate for  and this all-powerful titan would be  inherited by all for one  the founding titan is basically  invincible when used at its full  potential  i mean it can forcefully control other  titans at will and make them do what it  wants  which is reminiscent of how afo would  use force quirk activation  the founder can also manipulate the  memories of other people  to make them forget certain events and  it can change the composition  of other people's bodies all for one has  also consistently messed around with  other people's bodies  throughout his experiments with dr ujuko  to create the nomu  when the founding titan is at its full  power it's nearly unstoppable  and afo himself is the same think about  it it took  eight generations of one for all users  before someone was finally able to beat  all for one  so it just shows you that he's on  another level compared to all the other  characters  if he was in attack on titan then the  founder would be the only titan worthy  of someone like him moving on to the  female titan  as the name suggests it has to be a girl  who inherits this one  and i think this would go to himiko toga  the female titan is ruthless  agile and it has a spoilery ability that  i'll get to later  all those qualities make toga the ideal  candidate because she's shown her  agility and athleticism  not to mention her ruthlessness the  possessor of this titan should also be  good at going undercover  and this is something that we've seen  toga do on many an occasion whether it  was  you know during the provisional license  exam or during the overhaul arc  you know infiltration is basically what  she does now  both toga and the female titan have  special abilities  that haven't been mentioned in the anime  for both my hero  and attack on titan so skip to the time  stamp if you don't want to know these  major spoilers  it was revealed in the attack on titan  manga that the female titan is  especially good  at replicating the abilities of other  titans if it consumes a part of them  this is similar to toga's new ability  which she discovered during the myvlan  academia arc  and this is where she can mimic the  quirk of someone she loves  if she consumes their blood what this  means  is that both the female titan and toga  can copy the powers of someone else  through consumption so the parallels are  just way too clear for her  not to be this titan shifter the seventh  titan on this list  is the beast titan and i consider it to  be one of my personal favorites  while the beast titan may look like a  giant disproportionately sized monkey  the intro for season 3 showed us that  not all beast titans have to take this  form  rather the appearance of a beast titan  will be dictated by  you know it's not it's unclear but what  we saw was that zeke used to be a fan of  monkeys  and that's what he became when he was a  titan so in theory there could be any  type of animal as a beast titan  depending on what that person likes i  guess that's what it is  i originally considered that koda might  get the beast titan due to his love of  animals  but ultimately there was someone who was  way better suited to getting this titan  tamaki amajiki would be the one to get  the beast titan  because he knows best how to use animal  characteristics in battle  whether tamaki was turned into a cow  titan or a squid titan or a chicken  titan  or anything else i mean he would be the  best person to know how to use it  properly  although he may be timid and quite  nervous at times at the end of the day  he is one of the top three students at  ua  so if he was in the attack on titan  universe then he would definitely be one  of the top candidates to inherit the  beast titan and uh yeah i'm sure he  would get it in the end  the colossal titan is up next and this  was actually the first titan shifter we  ever saw in the series  standing over 60 meters tall it's been  described as a god of destruction  and is easily capable of wiping out  towns or cities  if used correctly unlike other titans  the colossal can choose to create a  massive explosion upon transforming  which has an incredible power its size  also means that it can crush  large areas just by walking forwards and  as we saw in seasons 2 and 3  the user of the colossal can burn people  up with its steam  or just blow them away there were a few  people i had in mind to inherit this  titan  mainly those with gigantification quirks  like mount lady or gigantomachia  however due to developments in the my  hero manga which i won't go into  i feel that shigeru raki is the  embodiment of what this titan represents  this colossal titan is only good for  destruction like  what else can it do besides destroying  things i can't think of a good reason  obviously you have the wall titans which  are similar but not identical  um so when we're talking about the real  colossal titan  yeah it's only good for destroying  things and so shigeraki would have to  inherit it because  he is destruction personified and all he  wants to do is destroy things  finally the last of the nine titans is  the cart titan  which is a handy shifter but uh  definitely the least intimidating of the  nine  the kart titan walks on four legs and is  able to stay in titan form for a very  long time  it can be used to carry supplies or as  we saw in season 4  it can have weapons planted on top of it  my decision on who would get this titan  was more of a gut feeling  and the person i chose was mineta i just  feel like if there was someone  who would walk around on all fours and  carry things for other people  minetta would probably be the one to do  it if he thought he'd get something out  of it  that being said it's guaranteed that he  would also complain a lot  whilst doing so and there you have it  guys that was my list on which micro  academia characters  would inherit the nine titans hit that  like button if you like this video  and let me know your selections down  below until the next one  peace out

